Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:45.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单第一轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:45.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}贝雷蒂尼 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁴ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}³ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 瓦林卡 · 赛后告别仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:01.34,EN,,0,0,0,,wonderful memories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:01.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多美好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:04.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure an emotional moment for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,此刻你一定百感交集
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的，确实
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,First, congrats Mateo and your team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先，恭喜马特奥和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,to the Grand Slam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.14,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a two time good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一场好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I wish you the best for the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你在往后的生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:16.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of your career and this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,和这项赛事里一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats. But for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你。而对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.14,EN,,0,0,0,,it's been more than 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经过去二十多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.38,EN,,0,0,0,,since the first time I came here in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,从我第一次来到纽约算起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,It was I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.86,EN,,0,0,0,,when I played the quali the first year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一年我打的是资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.62,EN,,0,0,0,,it was impressive for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种感觉太震撼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to to feel the New York vibes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,感受纽约的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.02,EN,,0,0,0,,the the energy of this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,感受这项赛事的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:37.98,EN,,0,0,0,,But over the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些年里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.82,EN,,0,0,0,,I received so much support,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得到了太多支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:41.74,EN,,0,0,0,,so much love because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多的爱，都来自你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:43.42,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I really enjoy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:43.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很享受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:46.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I find a way how to play my best here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:46.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这里打出了最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:48.54,EN,,0,0,0,,It was it was always really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里永远都很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And tonight again was one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚又一次证明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:53.34,EN,,0,0,0,,of the reason why I kept playing until 41
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我打到41岁的原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.34,EN,,0,0,0,,is to leave those moments like you gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是为了留下今晚这样的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.94,EN,,0,0,0,,tonight like you gave us tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们今晚给了我，给了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Amazing support.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的支持太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:02.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:18.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Even I went back to Switzerland
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至已经回了瑞士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:19.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后又飞了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I would like to thanks the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.10,EN,,0,0,0,,for the wild card because for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了我这张外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to have this opportunity to finish here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为能在这里收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:28.46,EN,,0,0,0,,was was really meaningful for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我个人意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:29.42,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm super grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:29.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我无比感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,to have received the wild card
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,能拿到这张外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:32.94,EN,,0,0,0,,because it was something important
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这件事很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,for me to have the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,它让我有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to finish the four Grand Slam here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里打完这四个大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York 10 years after winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,在纽约，在我夺冠10年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:42.22,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm going to miss it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一定会想念它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm going to miss it big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,会非常非常想念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:02:00.06,EN,,0,0,0,,But I'm... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:02:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我……谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:03.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:05.50,EN,,0,0,0,,I love I love the game so much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我太爱这项运动了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.62,EN,,0,0,0,,that I really try to push until my own limit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我一直把自己逼到极限
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and this year it is my own limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,而今年，就是我的极限
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.22,EN,,0,0,0,,So I really want to thank you all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的想谢谢你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.34,EN,,0,0,0,,for all those years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢这么多年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:18.10,EN,,0,0,0,,all those support was really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些支持真的太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.54,EN,,0,0,0,,ladies and gentlemen to mark this occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，为纪念这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:34.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Craig Tiley,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:34.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请克雷格·泰利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,CEO of the USTA, and Eric Butorac,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,美国网协CEO，以及布托拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.54,EN,,0,0,0,,US Open tournament director
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网赛事总监
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to present Stan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们将为斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.02,EN,,0,0,0,,with a very special memento
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,送上一份特别的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for this occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,以纪念此刻
